<title>USA: Hopkinton SD, N.H., won by A.G. Edwards.</title>
<headline>Hopkinton SD, N.H., won by A.G. Edwards.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons said it won $6.992 million of Hopkinton SD, N.H., general obligation school bonds, with a net interest cost of 4.93 percent.</p>
</text>
